{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2022-06-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE MORGAN STANLEY U.S. FINANCIALS, PAYMENTS & CRE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHRIS CONCANNON, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, AND CHRIS GEROSA, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE MORGAN STANLEY U.S. FINANCIALS, PAYMENTS AND CRE CONFERENCE ON JUNE 14, 2022 AT 1:45 P.M. ET.'}